3. Choosing the cell and the shape at a fixed group and rate: 12 cut arms and the scalar rule
   regret = measured error of the pick over the smallest measured error, in dB. hit = the pick is the measured best.
   formula: level 3 on the matrix. level 1: without the wall and the cell at zero. shuffled: level 3 on the same entries in random places.
   round: always E8 in a ball, the best region for a round cloud (proved in the plan). ball or cross: the better of E8 in a ball and E8 in a cross-polytope, chosen by measuring both.
   family | group | rate | formula: mean regret, max, hits, rank corr. | level 1: mean, max, hits | shuffled: mean, max, hits | round: mean, max | best over ball or cross: mean, max | matrices
